title: Ignore files Git should not track
title-zh: 忽略 Git 不该跟踪的文件
---
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+file shopping.tmp
eggs, milk, flour
+end
$ git status
+file .gitignore
# Temporary files from my editor
*.tmp
+end
$ git status
$ git add .gitignore
$ git commit -m "Ignore temporary files"
$ git status
